# 44. Final Database Model

The core relational model is:

                         EVENT
                           |
              +------------+------------+
              |                         |
              v                         v
       EVENT_SETTINGS                  TEAM
                                         |
                                         |
                                         v
                                   TEAM_MEMBER

                         EVENT
                           |
                           |
                           v
                      SCORE_EVENT
                        /     \
                       /       \
                      v         v
                    TEAM       USER

The responsibilities are:

    Event
        Competition identity and lifecycle.

    EventSettings
        Configurable event settings.

    Team
        Current participating team state and score.

    TeamMember
        Individual participants.

    User
        Authenticated administrators and authorised users.

    ScoreEvent
        Historical scoring audit trail.

